      statement: "supply_chain_summary.internal_dep reports 1 file/480 symbols where the sole path is '<external>' placeholder; supply_chain_summary.external_dep reports 10 files but includes ALL workspace pyproject.toml files (packages/hypergumbo-core/pyproject.toml, packages/hypergumbo-tracker/pyproject.toml, etc.) plus '<external>' and empty-string '' paths"  # 0ab3
